Once upon a time.
There were three ancient deities:
The Infinitely Creative, Hyla
The Scourge of Order, Rudahn 
And the one in between, bored beyond belief. 
Dimentios.
The Lord in Limbo hated the concept of alternate universes.
He yearned for the Union of Universes.